<title>USA: Chicago Dock &amp; Canal to be acquired.</title>
<headline>Chicago Dock &amp; Canal to be acquired.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Dock &amp; Canal Trust said Friday it signed a definitive agreement to be acquired by Newsweb Corp for $21.00 per share in cash.</p>
<p>The stock closed Friday at 15-1/2.</p>
<p>The Trust has about 5.8 million shares outstanding, resulting in a total value for the transaction, including liabilities assumed, of over $150 million, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects the merger, which is subject to approval of shareholders, to close by year end.</p>
</text>
